## Files derived from the LumenPnP design

Files in pcb/ and print/ that are derived from the LumenPnP hardware design (Gerber files, print
files, DXF exports of plates) are licensed under the CERN Open Hardware Licence Version 2 – Weakly
Reciprocal (CERN-OHL-W v2), like the original design. Full text: https://cern.ch/cern-ohl

The original license and copyright notice of the LumenPnP project, reproduced as it requires:

> LumenPnP is (c) by Opulo
>
> This notice must be included in any distributions of this project or derivative works.
>
> Because this project consists of many types of source, individual parts of the project are made
> available under different licenses.
>
> 1. The hardware designs located at `./pnp/cad` and `./pnp/pcb` are available under the
>    CERN-OHL-W v2 license. Full text is available at https://cern.ch/cern-ohl.
> 2. The software located at `./.github/workflows` is available under Mozilla MPL v2.0. Full text
>    is available at https://www.mozilla.org/en-US/MPL/2.0/.
> 3. The KiCAD libraries located at `./lib/kicad/` are available under Creative Commons
>    Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0). Full text available at
>    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/
> 4. Opulo's logo, branding, and other media is used throughout this project. This is Copyright (c)
>    Opulo and all rights are reserved. You may not distribute derivative works or products bearing
>    the Opulo logo, icon, or other relevant mark. Derivative works should remove Opulo branding.
> 5. The name `Opulo` and `LumenPnP` are trademarked, and only to be used by Opulo. Any derivative
>    works should remove both marks.

